---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { breadcrumbSchema } from "../../utils/seo";

const siteUrl = "https://healthymindspecialists.com";
const staffName = "Florencia, LMHC";
const staffRole = "Licensed Therapist";
const staffSlug = "florencia-lmhc";
const tagline =
  "A place to make sense of life's changes, reconnect with yourself, and move forward.";
const profileImage =
  "https://imagedelivery.net/B5r6pMfQRTYBHyjgaDFr8w/41d1d55e-e99e-4c5f-d929-4ea646536000/public";

const schemas = [
  breadcrumbSchema([
    { name: "Home", url: siteUrl },
    { name: "About Us", url: `${siteUrl}/about` },
    { name: staffName, url: `${siteUrl}/staff/${staffSlug}` },
  ]),
];
---

<Layout
  title={staffName}
  description={`Meet ${staffName}, ${staffRole} at Healthy Mind Specialists in Tampa, FL. Bilingual therapy in English and Spanish for adults and couples navigating anxiety, depression, trauma, relationship challenges, and life transitions.`}
  schema={schemas}
  navOnLight
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class='relative calm-gradient pt-36 pb-20 md:pt-44 md:pb-24 overflow-hidden'>
    <div
      class='absolute -top-40 -right-32 w-[520px] h-[520px] rounded-full bg-calm-lavender/80 blur-[130px] calm-float pointer-events-none'
      aria-hidden='true'
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class='absolute -bottom-44 -left-40 w-[480px] h-[480px] rounded-full bg-calm-blush/70 blur-[140px] calm-float-slow pointer-events-none'
      aria-hidden='true'
    >
    </div>

    <div
      class='relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center'
    >
      <div class='lg:col-span-7 order-2 lg:order-1'>
        <span
          class='inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/30 bg-brand-white/60 px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-brand-gold-dark mb-8'
        >
          <span class='w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-gold' aria-hidden='true'
          ></span>
          Therapy in English and Spanish
        </span>
        <h1
          class='text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-display font-semibold text-brand-charcoal leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.015em]'
        >
          {staffName}
        </h1>
        <p
          class='mt-5 text-xl md:text-2xl font-display italic text-brand-gold-dark'
        >
          {staffRole}
        </p>
        <p
          class='mt-7 text-brand-charcoal/65 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed max-w-xl'
        >
          {tagline}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='lg:col-span-5 order-1 lg:order-2'>
        <div class='relative mx-auto max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm lg:max-w-none'>
          <div
            class='absolute -inset-3 rounded-t-[999px] rounded-b-[2.5rem] border border-brand-gold/25 pointer-events-none'
            aria-hidden='true'
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class='relative h-[360px] sm:h-[440px] lg:h-[480px] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[999px] rounded-b-[2.5rem] bg-calm-lavender'
          >
            <img
              src={profileImage}
              alt={`Portrait of ${staffName}, ${staffRole} at Healthy Mind Specialists`}
              width='354'
              height='768'
              class='w-full h-full object-cover object-[center_25%]'
              loading='eager'
              fetchpriority='high'
            />
            <div
              class='absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-gold/30 via-transparent to-calm-blush/40 mix-blend-soft-light pointer-events-none'
              aria-hidden='true'
            >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class='bg-brand-white py-20 md:py-28'>
    <div class='max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6'>
      <!-- Bio Content -->
      <span
        class='font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-brand-muted block mb-6'
      >
        About Florencia
      </span>
      <div
        class='max-w-none text-brand-charcoal/70 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed space-y-7'
      >
        <p>
          Life rarely unfolds exactly as we expect. Relationships change, roles
          shift, and new stages of life can leave us questioning who we are,
          what we want, or how to move forward. Therapy can offer a place to
          make sense of those changes, reconnect with yourself, and begin making
          choices that feel healthier and more aligned with the life you want to
          create.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a Licensed Mental Health Counselor (LMHC), I work with adults and
          couples navigating anxiety, depression, trauma, emotional regulation,
          relationship challenges, and life transitions. I particularly enjoy
          working with women through the different stages of adulthood,
          including changes in relationships, separation or divorce, and the
          emotional challenges that can accompany menopause. Helping clients
          strengthen their relationships, improve communication, rebuild
          confidence, and recognize their own strengths is some of the most
          meaningful work I do.
        </p>
        <p>
          My style in the therapy room is warm, conversational, and
          collaborative, but I am also practical when you need me to be. I
          believe therapy should give you room to talk and feel understood while
          also helping you begin working on the concerns that brought you in. I
          offer practical feedback and, when it may help you grow, I will gently
          challenge you to consider a situation from a different perspective.
          Meaningful change takes time, but I want you to feel that you are
          beginning to move forward from the start.
        </p>
        <p>
          I take a holistic and integrative approach to therapy, recognizing
          that emotional well-being is shaped by our thoughts, emotions,
          relationships, behaviors, life experiences, and circumstances. I draw
          from Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT), person-centered therapy,
          solution-focused strategies, and psychodynamic concepts to help us
          address what is happening in your life today while also exploring
          deeper patterns that may be influencing how you feel and respond.
        </p>
        <p>
          I provide therapy in both English and Spanish and tailor our work to
          your individual needs, pace, and goals. Whether you are struggling in
          a relationship, adjusting to an unexpected change, trying to rebuild
          your confidence, or simply realizing that something in your life needs
          to be different, my goal is to create a space where you can be
          yourself, gain greater clarity, and feel supported as you decide what
          comes next.
        </p>
        <p>
          I know firsthand that life does not always follow the plan we
          imagined. I originally came to the United States thinking I would stay
          for only two years. Twenty-five years later, I am still here! Life
          clearly had other ideas, and perhaps that is one reason I appreciate
          how unexpected transitions can lead us in directions we never
          anticipated.
        </p>
        <p>
          Wherever you are in your own journey, you do not have to figure
          everything out alone. Together, we can work toward stronger
          relationships, greater confidence, and choices that feel more
          connected to who you are and where you want to go.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class='mt-16 text-center'>
        <a
          href='/contact'
          class='inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-brand-gold-dark text-white text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] uppercase rounded-full transition-all duration-400 hover:bg-brand-blue-light'
        >
          Schedule a Consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
